# ---------- Terraform provider cache ----------
**/.terraform/

# The lock file of a root module belongs in the repository: it pins provider
# versions and their checksums, exactly as go.sum does, and a clone without it
# can silently resolve different providers. The ones under modules/ are
# artifacts of the per-module `terraform init -backend=false` that CI runs to
# validate each module on its own -- those are not root modules anyone applies.
deployments/terraform/modules/**/.terraform.lock.hcl
